VALUES ('leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co/<CAPBs_a7Tq2LmV9xYcR4KdN8wUe3HsJ6oFbZ1gPiA5tGyQnE0Xw@mail.gmail.com>', 'leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co/1857029474983245439', 'leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co', '["SENT", "Label_b19fb8d1b3"]', 'Thanks, got it. I''ll get this to you before the 27th. Leonard On Fri, Feb 13, 2026 at 8:48 AM PERSON_3088_NAME <PERSON_3088_EMAIL> wrote: > ', 1771002760000, '2026-02-13T17:12:40Z', 2787, 'Re: GRIFFIN GAMING PARTNERS 2025 Audit Request [SOURCE_ORG_0001], Inc.', 'leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co', 'leonard hayes', '["PERSON_3088_NAME <PERSON_3088_EMAIL>"]', '["PERSON_4416_NAME <PERSON_4416_EMAIL>", "PERSON_2322_NAME <PERSON_2322_EMAIL>", "PERSON_2847_EMAIL"]', '[]', '[]', E'Thanks, got it. I''ll get this to you before the 27th.\r\n\r\nLeonard\r\n\r\nOn Fri, Feb 13, 2026 at 8:48 AM PERSON_3088_NAME <PERSON_3088_EMAIL> wrote:\r\n\r\n> Hello,\r\n>\r\n> KPMG is currently engaged in the audit of GRIFFIN GAMING PARTNERS for the year ended December 31, 2025. The financial statements are covered by the Standard Metrics upload, so there is no need to send those again. For the fund''s investment in [SOURCE_ORG_0001], Inc., please confirm the below as of December 31, 2025 and return directly to us via email by replying to all Recipients herein:\r\n>\r\n> 1. Shares outstanding by class, showing what each fund holds.\r\n> 2. Each outstanding option line by holder, and their total, using each effective date as Carta shows it, regardless of when recorded.\r\n> 3. Shares outstanding plus those options, as one figure.\r\n> 4. Any financing or other significant event since that date.\r\n>\r\n> We appreciate your response by 2/27/2026. Should you have any questions, please feel free to contact us directly.\r\n>\r\n> Thank you in advance,\r\n>\r\n> [PERSON_NAME_46103] (she/her/[PERSON_NAME_13208])\r\n> Audit Associate\r\n> KPMG LLP | 55 Second Street | Suite 1400 | San Francisco, CA 94105\r\n> PERSON_3088_EMAIL\r\n> kpmg.com/us\r\n>\r\n> **********************************************************************\r\n> The information in this email is confidential and may be legally privileged. It is intended solely for the addressee. Access to this email by anyone else is unauthorized. If you are not the intended recipient, any disclosure, copying, distribution or any action taken or omitted to be taken in reliance on it, is prohibited and may be unlawful. When addressed to our clients any opinions or advice contained in this email are subject to the terms and conditions expressed in the governing KPMG client engagement letter.\r\n> ***********************************************************************\r\n', NULL, '[{"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<CAPBs_a7Tq2LmV9xYcR4KdN8wUe3HsJ6oFbZ1gPiA5tGyQnE0Xw@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Fri, 13 Feb 2026 09:12:40 -0800"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: GRIFFIN GAMING PARTNERS 2025 Audit Request [SOURCE_ORG_0001], Inc."}, {"name": "From", "value": "leonard hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "PERSON_3088_NAME <PERSON_3088_EMAIL>"}, {"name": "Cc", "value": "PERSON_4416_NAME <PERSON_4416_EMAIL>, PERSON_2322_NAME <PERSON_2322_EMAIL>, PERSON_2847_EMAIL"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<LV3PR19MB8524F1C07D3A94E26B58D0AC7A1E2@LV3PR19MB8524.namprd19.prod.outlook.com>"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<LV3PR19MB8524F1C07D3A94E26B58D0AC7A1E2@LV3PR19MB8524.namprd19.prod.outlook.com>"}]', '<LV3PR19MB8524F1C07D3A94E26B58D0AC7A1E2@LV3PR19MB8524.namprd19.prod.outlook.com>', '<LV3PR19MB8524F1C07D3A94E26B58D0AC7A1E2@LV3PR19MB8524.namprd19.prod.outlook.com>', NULL, '[]');
