ort, log in and open the Carta Help Center from the user\r\nmenu at the top right of the page. Open Carta Help Center →\r\n<https://app.Carta.com/profiles/update/?help=true> \r\n\r\n  eShares, Inc. DBA Carta, Inc. \r\n 333 Bush Street, Suite 2300 \r\n San Francisco, CA 94104 \r\n [PHONE_14952] <tel:[PHONE_14951]>', NULL, '[{"name": "Message-ID", "value": "<170056300100.11.4471902385519067321@notifications-worker-75f77576db-lb9sh>"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Tue, 21 Nov 2023 10:36:41 +0000"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Carta activity for Nov. 20, 2023"}, {"name": "From", "value": "SVC_0077_NAME <SVC_0077_EMAIL>"}, {"name": "To", "value": "leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]');
